** After opener's new suit at the one level

Responder raises the new major with four cards (2 = 6--10, 3 = 11--12 invites,
4 = 13+), bids notrump by strength (1NT 6--10, 2NT 11--12 invites, 3NT 13+),
rebids a six-card suit (6--10), gives preference to opener's first suit with
four cards (6--10), and otherwise passes.

